OL,3,GNEWSACookery classes help Afghan pupil
OL,4,A'feel at home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Karen Tearle said the
OL,7,Fscheme had made a greater impact on her
OL,8,Fthan almost anything else in her 28
OL,9,Fyears of teaching.
